{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"leathery-druidic-nurseshark","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\nDuring the execution-phase plan review for c61a-9f8f-8ef9-4601, multiple overlap-judge calls each took 301–311 seconds. The provider returned oversized malformed JSON with runaway/repeated candidate_id content; contract validation then failed at EOF around columns 26k–48k. The helper safely abstained, so correctness was preserved, but the repeated calls added more than 20 minutes to one review.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Reproduce the malformed oversized candidate_id response at the overlap-judge contract boundary.\n- Bound generated/accepted response size and wall-clock duration without converting abstention into a false overlap match.\n- Preserve structured diagnostics that distinguish provider timeout, output-size rejection, and JSON/contract failure.\n- Add behavioral tests for valid responses, malformed oversized responses, and timeout/abstention behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A runaway candidate_id response cannot consume unbounded output tokens or exceed the configured overlap-judge time budget.\n- [ ] Oversized or malformed responses produce a deterministic safe abstention and a bounded diagnostic.\n- [ ] Valid overlap judgments retain their current behavior.\n- [ ] Tests reproduce the observed EOF/runaway-output failure mode and prove the bound has teeth.\n\n## Evidence\n\nObserved on 2026-08-07 while reviewing c61a: several calls lasted 301–311 seconds and failed JSON validation at EOF after approximately 26k–48k columns.","id":"22da-e9a6-63e7-49e5","parent_id":"","priority":1,"tags":["llm","plan-review","reliability"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Bound overlap-judge output and latency on malformed candidate-id responses"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786141544541436001,"uuid":"5e0f13de-41d9-45a5-9e18-e703587ebc4f"}